    "long_instructions": "Here is a student explanation about the auto-logout security feature on their device: \r\n>Auto-logout works well because it protects users. If a feature increases security, that means it works for everyone.\r\n\r\nIs this explanation accurate or inaccurate? If inaccurate, briefly explain what the student may have overlooked.",
