    "teacher_markdown": "**Assessment Opportunity**\r\n\r\nThis level can be used to confirm students understand how a security feature’s intended purpose can conflict with usability.\r\n\r\n- If students respond that the explanation is accurate, pause to revisit the case studies and highlight usability barriers such as frustration, accessibility issues, or task disruption.\r\n- If students say the explanation is incomplete but cannot articulate why, prompt them to consider user-specific needs and unintended consequences.\r\n- If students demonstrate strong understanding, move on to Level 1 where they will analyze a persona’s interactions with security features.",
